  (descr "CC-Antenna-DK (SWRR070, rev 1.0.2) board #5: 45 x 95 mm, 2-layer FR-4. A 2 mm wide L-shaped strip of about 86 mm (a quarter wave at 868 MHz), on both layers. Port at the uSMA feed line; the series matching positions are bridged (0 ohm) and the shunt positions are left open, as for the antenna without matching components. The 0.25 mm stitching vias are left out (they would make the mesh huge).")
